    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 8 St Nicholas Place is a charming two-bedroom red-brick terraced residence ideally positioned on a quiet residential street in the heart of Dublin 8. Requiring modernisation and upgrading throughout, the property offers an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking to put their own stamp on a home in a highly convenient city location.\nExtending to approximately 60 sq.m / 646. sq. Ft., the accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance porch leading to a spacious living room. To the rear is a kitchen with access to the rear courtyard, while an inner hallway connects to a shower room. Upstairs, there are two bedrooms, including a generous double bedroom to the front and a single bedroom to the rear.\nThe location is second to none, with a wealth of amenities within walking distance including shops, cafés, restaurants and excellent public transport links. The Liberties, Newmarket Square, St. Stephen's Green and Dublin City Centre are all within easy reach, making this an ideal home for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a city base."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch: - \nLeading to the main living accommodation.\n\nLiving Room: - 5.75 x 3.95m\nBright and generously proportioned reception room positioned to the front of the property, featuring a fireplace and ample space for both living and dining areas.\n\nKitchen - 2.81m x 2.04m\nGalley-style kitchen fitted with a range of wall and floor units, sink unit and provision for appliances. Door provides access to the rear courtyard.\n\nInner Hallway: - 1.44m x 1.52m\nConnecting the kitchen and bathroom with staircase access to the first floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.83m x 1.52m\nFully tiled shower room fitted with a walk-in shower, WC, wash hand basin and heated towel rail.\n\nLanding - 2.29m x 0.97m\nProviding access to both bedrooms.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.36m x 3.95m\nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the front of the property, complete with fitted wardrobes and fireplace.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.29m x 2.89m\ndoyble bedroom positioned to the rear with fitted storage and pleasant outlook over neighbouring rooftops.\n\n"
      },
      {
